://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/archipelago-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-democracy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"democracy","sort_order":1,"sense":"民主","alt_zh":"成年老師與高中生用成年公民投票、公開議事的城市模型討論制度。","example":"The civics lesson explored how democracy gives citizens a voice.","example_zh":"公民課探討民主如何讓公民發聲。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/democracy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-governor-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"governor","sort_order":1,"sense":"州長","alt_zh":"虛構成年州長與高中生、老師在圖書館模型旁友善交流，無真實黨徽。","example":"The governor visited the school to discuss the new library.","example_zh":"州長到學校討論新圖書館。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/governor-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-mayor-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"mayor","sort_order":1,"sense":"市長","alt_zh":"虛構成年市長與高中、成年志工在安全河岸集合準備清理垃圾。","example":"The mayor welcomed volunteers to the riverside cleanup.","example_zh":"市長歡迎志工參加河岸清潔。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/mayor-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prosecutor-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prosecutor","sort_order":1,"sense":"檢察官","alt_zh":"成年檢察官在莊重法庭向法官展示無字資料，無犯罪畫面。","example":"The prosecutor presented documents during the trial.","example_zh":"檢察官在審判中提出文件。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prosecutor-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-attorney-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"attorney","sort_order":1,"sense":"律師","alt_zh":"成年女律師在安靜辦公室耐心向成年當事人說明無字文件。","example":"The attorney e